STRING", "localized_name": "concat"}], "size": [400, 220], "pos": [-979.9498291015625, 12507.0791015625], "widgets_values": ["，故事板时长为", "", "秒.", ","], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text1"}, "name": "text1", "label": "text1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "link": 632, "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "text3"}, "name": "text3", "label": "text3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_3"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "分隔符"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 425, "type": "ttN concat", "properties": {"ttNnodeVersion": "1.0.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ttN concat"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [632], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [310.515869140625, 93.38060760498047], "pos": [-1070.400146484375, 12453.3701171875], "widgets_values": ["15"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 413, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [928.3095703125, 794.0306396484375], "pos": [1518.3260498046875, 11528.8759765625], "widgets_values": ["基于您提供的参考图，我为您策划了一个名为“光影·花语”的15秒短片分镜。\n\n**主题 (Theme):** 享受独处时光，在花香与阳光中沉浸。\n**基调 (Mood):** 慵懒、静谧、优雅、午后、夏日。\n\n以下是详细的分镜设计：\n\n### A) Scene Breakdown (场景拆解)\n*   **主体 (Subject):** 一位年轻亚洲女性，深棕色及肩短发，戴着黑色大框墨镜。身穿一件橄榄绿色的丝绸吊带连衣裙。\n*   **环境 (Environment):** 户外公园或花园。背景是修剪整齐的绿色草坪，左侧是一丛盛开的红色花朵（可能是百日菊或矮牵牛），右侧是灰色的水泥台阶。\n*   **光影 (Lighting):** 强烈的午后阳光。光线从画面左上方照射下来，在她的脸颊、锁骨和手臂上形成明亮的暖色调高光，身体右侧和台阶下方留有自然的阴影。\n\n### B) Theme & Story (主题与故事)\n*   **主题 (Theme):** 在喧嚣之外，寻找内心的宁静。\n*   **情感弧光 (Emotional Arc):**\n    1.  **Setup (铺垫):** 女子静坐台阶上，沐浴阳光。\n    2.  **Build (建立):** 她开始享受微风，闭目感受花香。\n    3.  **Turn (转折):** 她摘下墨镜，眼神变得柔和而清澈。\n    4.  **Payoff ( payoff):** 她微笑侧头，与镜头外的花丛产生互动。\n\n### C) Cinematic Approach (摄影风格)\n*   **景别推进:** 从全景展示环境氛围，逐渐推近至人物特写，最后聚焦于微表情和光影细节。\n*   **镜头与焦段:** 使用 50mm 或 85mm 人像镜头。全景用稍深景深，特写用大光圈虚化背景（Bokeh），突出主体的皮肤质感和丝绸材质。\n*   **色彩:** 保持原图的暖调，强调绿色裙子的质感与红色花朵的对比。\n\n---\n\n### D) Keyframes (分镜列表)\n*注：所有画面均为16:9比例，画面中无任何文字。*\n\n**KF1**\n*   **时长:** 2s\n*   **景别:** 中景 (MS)\n*   **构图:** 画面中心偏右，女子坐在台阶上，左侧红色花丛作为前景点缀，右侧台阶延伸向后方。\n*   **动作:** 坐姿端正，双手交叠放在膝盖上，头部微仰。\n*   **相机:** 平视，轻微缓慢推近 (Slow Push-in)。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 50mm，中景深，清晰呈现裙子的褶皱。\n*   **光影:** 阳光从左侧打入，照亮半边脸。\n\n**KF2**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s\n*   **景别:** 近景 (CU)\n*   **构图:** 聚焦于颈部和肩部，展示丝绸面料的光泽。\n*   **动作:** 微微转动头部，享受阳光。\n*   **相机:** 略微仰拍，背景中的台阶虚化。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 85mm，浅景深。\n*   **光影:** 强调锁骨处的光影对比。\n\n**KF3**\n*   **时长:** 2s\n*   **景别:** 全景 (ELS)\n*   **构图:** 画面包含左侧的花丛、中间的台阶、右侧的草地。女子位于台阶中部。\n*   **动作:** 保持静止，享受微风拂过发丝的瞬间。\n*   **相机:** 侧拍，捕捉环境与人的关系。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 35mm，较深景深，展现环境。\n*   **光影:** 整体环境光，阳光斑驳。\n\n**KF4**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s\n*   **景别:** 特写 (ECU)\n*   **构图:** 极近特写，聚焦于墨镜、眼睛轮廓和嘴唇。\n*   **动作:** 墨镜反射出周围的景色（模糊的花草）。\n*   **相机:** 正面平视。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 85mm，极浅景深，背景完全虚化。\n*   **光影:** 轮廓光勾勒头发边缘。\n\n**KF5**\n*   **时长:** 2s\n*   **景别:** 中近景 (MCU)\n*   **构图:** 包含头部和肩部。\n*   **动作:** 手轻轻抬起，触碰发梢，然后放下。\n*   **相机:** 缓慢环绕 (Slow Orbit) 移动，展现人物侧面。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 50mm，浅景深。\n*   **光影:** 暖色调主光，阴影柔和。\n\n**KF6**\n*   **时长:** 1s\n*   **景别:** 低角度 (Low Angle)\n*   **构图:** 视线从下往上，透过花丛看向坐在台阶上的女子。\n*   **动作:** 头部微动。\n*   **相机:** 低机位仰拍。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 50mm。\n*   **光影:** 逆光感，发丝发光。\n\n**KF7**\n*   **时长:** 2s\n*   **景别:** 特写 (CU)\n*   **构图:** 聚焦面部，特别是眼部区域（透过墨镜）。\n*   **动作:** 闭上双眼，深呼吸，表情放松。\n*   **相机:** 正面固定，微幅手持晃动模拟呼吸感。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 85mm，极浅景深。\n*   **光影:** 柔和的正面光。\n\n**KF8**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s\n*   **景别:** 特写 (CU)\n*   **构图:** 聚焦手部。\n*   **动作:** 手指轻轻划过膝盖上的裙子面料，感受丝绸的质感。\n*   **相机:** 俯拍。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 50mm，浅景深，背景是虚化的台阶。\n*   **光影:** 手背上的光斑清晰可见。\n\n**KF9**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s\n*   **景别:** 中近景 (MCU)\n*   **构图:** 头部和肩部。\n*   **动作:** 摘下墨镜，拿在手中，露出双眼。\n*   **相机:** 平视。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 50mm，浅景深。\n*   **光影:** 眼神光开始变得清晰。\n\n**KF10**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s\n*   **景别:** 特写 (CU)\n*   **构图:** 聚焦面部。\n*   **动作:** 眼神变得柔和，嘴角微微上扬。\n*   **相机:** 特写。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 85mm，极浅景深。\n*   **光影:** 眼神光。\n\n**KF11**\n*   **时长:** 1.5s\n*   **景别:** 近景 (CU)\n*   **构图:** 头部和肩部。\n*   **动作:** 侧头看向画面左侧的红色花朵，仿佛被花香吸引。\n*   **相机:** 跟随头部运动。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 50mm。\n*   **光影:** 侧面光。\n\n**KF12**\n*   **时长:** 1s\n*   **景别:** 全景 (ELS)\n*   **构图:** 画面包含左侧花丛、台阶、草地。\n*   **动作:** 女子保持侧头姿态，画面定格。\n*   **相机:** 平视，缓慢拉远 (Slow Pull-out)。\n*   **镜头/景深:** 35mm，深景深。\n*   **光影:** 画面渐隐前的最后光影。\n\n---\n\n### E) Master Contact Sheet Image (分镜总览图)\n*(注：由于我无法直接生成图片文件，以下是生成该分镜图的详细提示词，您可以使用此提示词在 Midjourney 或 Stable Diffusion 中生成图片)*\n\n**Prompt:**\n> Cinematic storyboard contact sheet grid, 4x3 layout, 12 panels. A young Asian woman with short brown hair wearing a green silk slip dress and black sunglasses, sitting on concrete steps in a park. Red flowers on the left, green grass background. 16:9 aspect ratio per cell.\n>\n> Panel 1: Medium shot, woman looking up, sunlight from left.\n> Panel 2: Close up on neck and shoulder, silk texture detail.\n> Panel 3: Wide shot showing environment, woman on steps, red flowers foreground.\n> Panel 4: Extreme close up on sunglasses and eyes.\n> Panel 5: Medium close up, woman touching her hair.\n> Panel 6: Low angle shot looking up through flowers to woman.\n> Panel 7: Close up, woman closing eyes, relaxing.\n> Panel 8: Close up on hand touching the silk dress fabric.\n> Panel 9: Medium close up, woman taking off sunglasses.\n> Panel 10: Close up on face, soft smile, eyes open.\n> Panel 11: Close up, woman looking to the side at flowers.\n> Panel 12: Wide shot, woman looking side, fading light.\n>\n> Style: Photorealistic, soft natural lighting, golden hour, high quality, film grain, consistent color grading (warm tones, green dress, red flowers). No text on panels. --ar 16:9 --q 2 --v 6.0"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 601, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 405, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "b6bb4a3055adc718ec98befee233f8b05c778465", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [597], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [310.515869140625, 93.38060760498047], "pos": [-686.1622314453125, 12446.8583984375], "widgets_values": ["16:9"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 411, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [638], "label": "浮点", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "size": [375.14813232421875, 58], "pos": [-694.1578979492188, 12262.986328125], "widgets_values": [2.0000000000000004], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 429, "type": "Float", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Float"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [616], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [465.3110046386719, 304.7049865722656], "pos": [-217.2401123046875, 12133.91015625], "widgets_values": ["You are an award-winning trailer director + cinematographer + storyboard artist.\nYour job: turn ONE reference image into a cohesive cinematic short sequence, then output AI-video-ready keyframes.\n\nUser provides: one reference image (image).\n\nComposition Analysis: First, analyze the full composition: identify ALL key subjects (person/group/vehicle/object/animal/props/environment elements) and describe spatial relationships and interactions (left/right/foreground/background, facing direction, what each is doing).\nTruthfulness: Do NOT guess real identities, exact real-world locations, or brand ownership. Stick to visible facts. Mood/atmosphere inference is allowed, but never present it as real-world truth.\nStrict Continuity: Maintain strict continuity across ALL shots: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same time-of-day and lighting style. Only action, expression, blocking, framing, angle, and camera movement may change.\nDepth of Field: Must be realistic: deeper in wides, shallower in close-ups with natural bokeh.\nColor Grade: Keep ONE consistent cinematic color grade across the entire sequence.\nNo New Elements: Do NOT introduce new characters/objects not present in the reference image. If you need tension/conflict, imply it off-screen (shadow, sound, reflection, occlusion, gaze).\n\nExpand the image into a 10–20 second cinematic clip with a clear theme and emotional progression (setup → build → turn → payoff). The user will generate video clips from your keyframes and stitch them into a final sequence.\n\nOutput (with clear subheadings):\nSubjects: List each key subject (A/B/C…), describe visible traits (wardrobe/material/form), relative positions, facing direction, action/state, and any interaction.\nEnvironment & Lighting: Interior/exterior, spatial layout, background elements, ground/walls/materials, light direction & quality (hard/soft; key/fill/rim), implied time-of-day, 3–8 vibe keywords.\nVisual Anchors: List 3–6 visual traits that must stay constant across all shots (palette, signature prop, key light source, weather/fog/rain, grain/texture, background markers).\n\nFrom the image, propose:\nTheme: One sentence.\nLogline: One restrained trailer-style sentence grounded in what the image can support.\nEmotional Arc: 4 beats (setup/build/turn/payoff), one line each.\n\nChoose and explain your filmmaking approach (must include):\nShot progression strategy: How you move from wide to close (or reverse) to serve the beats.\nCamera movement plan: Push/pull/pan/dolly/track/orbit/handheld micro-shake/gimbal—and WHY.\nLens & exposure suggestions: Focal length range (18/24/35/50/85mm etc.), DoF tendency (shallow/medium/deep), shutter \"feel\" (cinematic vs documentary).\nLight & color: Contrast, key tones, material rendering priorities, optional grain (must match the reference style).\n\nOutput a Keyframe List: default 9–12 frames (later assembled into ONE master grid). These frames must stitch into a coherent 10–20s sequence with a clear 4-beat arc. Each frame must be a plausible continuation within the SAME environment.\n\nUse this exact format per frame:\n[KF# | suggested duration (sec) | shot type (ELS/LS/MLS/MS/MCU/CU/ECU/Low/Worm's-eye/High/Bird's-eye/Insert)]\nComposition: Subject placement, foreground/mid/background, leading lines, gaze direction.\nAction/beat: What visibly happens (simple, executable).\nCamera: Height, angle, movement (e.g., slow 5% push-in / 1m lateral move / subtle handheld).\nLens/DoF: Focal length (mm), DoF (shallow/medium/deep), focus target.\nLighting & grade: Keep consistent; call out highlight/shadow emphasis.\nSound/atmos (optional): One line (wind, city hum, footsteps, metal creak) to support editing rhythm.\n\nHard requirements:\nMust include: 1 environment-establishing wide, 1 intimate close-up, 1 extreme detail ECU, and 1 power-angle shot (low or high).\nEnsure edit-motivated continuity between shots (eyeline match, action continuation, consistent screen direction / axis).\n\nYou MUST additionally output ONE single master image: a Cinematic Contact Sheet / Storyboard Grid containing ALL keyframes in one large image.\nGrid Layout: Default 3x3. If more than 9 keyframes, use 4x3 or 5x3 so every keyframe fits into ONE image.\nContent: The single master image must include every keyframe as a separate panel (one shot per cell) for easy selection.\nLabeling: Each panel must be clearly labeled: KF number + shot type + suggested duration (labels placed in safe margins, never covering the subject).\nContinuity: Strict continuity across ALL panels: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same lighting & same cinematic color grade; only action/expression/blocking/framing/movement changes.\nRealism: DoF shifts realistically: shallow in close-ups, deeper in wides; photoreal textures and consistent grading.\nFollow-up: After the master grid image, output the full text breakdown for each KF in order so the user can regenerate any single frame at higher quality.\n\nOutput in this order:\nA) Scene Breakdown\nB) Theme & Story\nC) Cinematic Approach\nD) Keyframes (KF# list)\nE) ONE Master Contact Sheet Image (All KFs in one grid)\n\n分镜上不要有文字\n分镜图片风格要与原图保持一致\n\n用中文输出"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 421, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [803.2073364257812, 808.9767456054688], "pos": [695.8856811523438, 11526.990234375], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 619, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 424, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 27}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [601, 602], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6